gpt-5.5-2026-04-23            = third_party|openai|true|true|0|1000000|reasoning|text,image|text|true|GPT-5.5 — Flagship reasoning
gpt-5.4-2026-03-05            = third_party|openai|true|true|0|131072|reasoning|text,image|text|true|GPT-5.4 — Previous gen reasoning
gpt-5.4-mini-2026-03-17       = third_party|openai|true|true|0|131072|fast|text,image|text|true|GPT-5.4 Mini — Cost-efficient
gpt-audio-1.5                 = third_party|openai|true|false|0|128000|fast|text,audio|text,audio|false|GPT Audio 1.5 — Audio in/out
claude-fable-5                = third_party|anthropic|true|true|0|1000000|reasoning|text,image|text|true|Claude Fable 5 — Highest capability widely released
claude-opus-4-8               = third_party|anthropic|true|true|0|200000|reasoning|text,image|text|true|Claude Opus 4.8 — Flagship reasoning
claude-sonnet-4-6             = third_party|anthropic|true|true|0|200000|balanced|text,image|text|true|Claude Sonnet 4.6 — Fast reasoning
x-ai/grok-4.5                 = third_party|openrouter|true|true|0|131072|reasoning|text,image|text|true|Grok 4.5 — xAI flagship
google/gemini-3-flash-preview = third_party|openrouter|true|true|0|1000000|balanced|text,image|text|true|Gemini 3 Flash Preview
google/gemini-3.1-flash-image = third_party|openrouter|true|false|0|131072|balanced|text,image|text,image|false|Gemini 3.1 Flash Image — Image generation
openai/gpt-audio              = third_party|openrouter|true|false|0|128000|fast|text,audio|text,audio|false|GPT Audio — Audio in/out
openai/gpt-5.6-luna           = third_party|openrouter|true|true|0|1050000|balanced|text,image|text|true|GPT-5.6 Luna — Multimodal agent model
openai/gpt-5.4-image-2        = third_party|openrouter|true|false|0|272000|balanced|text,image|text,image|false|GPT-5.4 Image 2 — Image generation
openai/gpt-audio-mini         = third_party|openrouter|true|false|0|128000|fast|text,audio|text,audio|false|GPT Audio Mini — Cost-efficient audio in/out
moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code    = third_party|openrouter|true|true|0|262144|code|text,image|text|true|Kimi K2.7 Code — Moonshot AI
deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash   = third_party|openrouter|true|true|0|1048576|code|text|text|true|DeepSeek V4 Flash
